<title>USA: CVB Financial raises qtly payout.</title>
<headline>CVB Financial raises qtly payout.</headline>
<dateline>ONTARIO, Calif. 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>CVB Financial Corp Friday raised its quarterly dividend by 25 percent to $0.10 a share from $0.08 a share.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said the dividend will be paid on or about Jan. 21, 1997 to shareholders of record as of Jan. 3, 1997.</p>
<p>The company said the Board of Directors also declared a 10 percent stock dividend at its meeting on December 18. The dividend will be distributed on or about Jan. 21, 1997 to shareholders of record as of Jan. 6, 1997.</p>
</text>
